avs-cd N/ProjectHorizon
IF NOT EXISTS WHDSaves:ProjectHorizon
  makedir WHDSaves:ProjectHorizon
  copy #? WHDSaves:ProjectHorizon ALL CLONE QUIET
ENDIF
cd WHDSaves:ProjectHorizon
stack 65536
assign LIBS: WHDSaves:ProjectHorizon/libs ADD
ProjectHorizon >NIL:
assign LIBS: WHDSaves:ProjectHorizon/libs REMOVE
